# Quatricmorph core

- Canonical vision: `docs/PRODUCT_ARCHITECTURE_v1.md`; short form: `docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF.md`.
- Active coding track by default: visualization MVP (`docs/requirements/VIZ_MVP.md`, `prompts.md`) in `quatricmorph/`.
- Treat `mm/` as read-only reference. Do not delete it.
- Follow `AGENTS.md` and `docs/agent/CHARTER.md`.
- Check `docs/requirements/PREREQUISITES.md` before large features.
- Axioms: validate before success; no semantic claims without evidence; local-first; visualization backed by shared query/math substrate.
- Prefer small diffs. Do not invent Rust/Python platform code unless the task explicitly starts Track B.
